        ]
      },
      "frases": [
        {
          "es": "Las moʻo saltaron sobre ella con forma de lagarto, mordiendo y golpeando con la cola.",
          "en": "The moʻo leaped on her in lizard form, biting and lashing with their tails."
        },
        {
          "es": "Hiʻiaka las golpeó con su falda de rayos y les rompió el cuerpo. Pero tomaron cuerpos nuevos.",
          "en": "Hiʻiaka struck them with her lightning skirt and broke their bodies. But they took new bodies."
        },
        {
          "es": "Entonces, desde la isla de Hawaiʻi, la mujer de los helechos mandó su poder.",
          "en": "Then, from the island of Hawaiʻi, the fern woman sent her power."
        },
        {
          "es": "Helechos y raíces brotaron del suelo y les enredaron las patas.",
          "en": "Ferns and roots sprang from the ground and tangled the lizards' legs."
        },
        {
          "es": "Hiʻiaka golpeó otra vez, y las moʻo quedaron vencidas.",
          "en": "Hiʻiaka struck once more, and the moʻo were beaten."
        }
      ],
