      },
      "frases": [
        {
          "es": "Ya caía la tarde. No quedaba tiempo para subir, buscar el espíritu y bajar.",
          "en": "Evening was falling. There was no time left to climb, find the spirit, and come down."
        },
        {
          "es": "Westervelt cuenta que Hiʻiaka le pidió al sol que esperara. Y el sol esperó.",
          "en": "Westervelt tells that Hiʻiaka asked the sun to wait. And the sun waited."
        },
        {
          "es": "Entonces oyó una vocecita: «Estoy en un coco chiquito, bien cerrado».",
          "en": "Then she heard a tiny voice: \"I am in a little coconut shell, shut up tight.\""
        },
        {
          "es": "Sobre un coco cerrado con plumas había un pequeño arcoíris. Allí estaba el espíritu de Lohiʻau.",
          "en": "Above a coconut sealed with feathers rested a tiny rainbow. There was Lohiʻau's spirit."
        }
      ],
