      "frases": [
        {
          "es": "Y Pele rompió su juramento.",
          "en": "And Pele broke her oath."
        },
        {
          "es": "Mandó la lava hacia el bosque de lehua de Hiʻiaka, el que había prometido cuidar.",
          "en": "She sent the lava into Hiʻiaka's lehua forest, the one she had promised to protect."
        },
        {
          "es": "Los árboles de flores rojas ardieron uno tras otro.",
          "en": "The trees with red blossoms burned, one after another."
        },
        {
          "es": "Donde había un jardín, quedó lava negra y humo.",
          "en": "Where there had been a garden, there was black lava and smoke."
